== Two-flips-per-pancake method
n=2: method worst 1 = 2n-3; never-skip version always 2
n=3: method worst 3 = 2n-3; never-skip version always 4
n=4: method worst 5 = 2n-3; never-skip version always 6
n=5: method worst 7 = 2n-3; never-skip version always 8
n=6: method worst 9 = 2n-3; never-skip version always 10
n=7: method worst 11 = 2n-3; never-skip version always 12
six-stacks where the method uses 9 flips: 24 e.g. 2 6 5 1 3 4 fewest 4 method flips [2, 6, 4, 5, 2, 4, 2, 3, 2]
formula 2n-3: six -> 9  ten -> 17  twenty -> 37
formula 2n-2: six -> 10  ten -> 18  twenty -> 38
